## Session Startup Reference
- Read `SESSION_REPORT.md` first
- Load 5 mandatory skills: using-superpowers, user-communication-preferences, session-audit-report, hermes-profiles, validate-memories
- Run `hermes profile use <name>` per task type
- Profile routing: code→architect, research→analyst, design→creative, planning→exec, teaching→tutor, ops→adminbot, general→default

